>> Logging in with Master

- The Master user can be only logged in through the PrivateArk client, no other interface supports logging in with this special user
- 3-Factor Authentication:
1. Master user password (defined during installation)
2. Access to the RecPrvKey
3. Access only from the vault console and one additonal IP address (EmergencyStationIP)

